I am sitting at my table.
A young waiter comes near my table.
He has a small tray in his hands.
There is cutting chai and bun maska on the tray.
I make space on the table.
I put my phone to one side.
I say to the waiter, 'Bhaiya, please put it here.'
He puts the plate of bun maska on the table.
He also puts the glass of tea right there.
The tea is very hot.
I look at the waiter.
I ask, 'Bhaiya, will I get a napkin?'
He nods and says, 'Yes, madam.'
He takes a paper napkin out of his pocket.
He gives me the napkin.
I smile and say, 'Thank you very much, bhaiya.'
He also smiles.
Then he goes to the other table.
I look towards my tea.
It all looks very good.
